1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:11,000
Blessing grant oh God of nations on the isles of Fiji

2
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:22,000
As we stand united under noble banner blue

3
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:33,000
And we honour and defend the cause of freedom ever

4
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:43,000
Onward march together, God bless Fiji.

5
00:00:43,500 --> 00:00:53,000
For Fiji, ever Fiji, let our voices ring with pride

6
00:00:53,500 --> 00:01:03,000
For Fiji, ever Fiji, her name hail far and wide,

7
00:01:03,500 --> 00:01:14,000
A land of freedom, hope and glory to endure whatever befall

8
00:01:14,500 --> 00:01:25,000
May God bless Fiji forever more!